"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚，但 SBUS 要求将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为 「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:127
#: 7dbdc4e530c44abd920d1bc150082dee
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:129
#: b2ee85c339a840d898727844cc1fda11
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 R6 外还需要 T6 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 "
"「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:131
#: 107f6ec844534197a3bc33d879ae9c13
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T6 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:133
#: 04573f0782db4626b85a4af5b02b2841
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:136
#: b28b3fa38e874075965f6e6ec2274a9d
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:138
#: 3674014aa2d04221983825610e0405c9
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 Mini supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver). The defaults are also setup to allow DJI Goggle OSD support on "
"UART1."
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7 Mini 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。默认设置也支持在 "
"UART1 上使用 DJI Goggle OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:141
#: 6230d8d5d8ff4d0798cab2809413911e
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:143
#: 022756473819425f84ef0546415cddd5
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 Mini supports up to 9 outputs. M1 to M4 are accessed via the "
"connector and are :ref:`bi-directional<bidir-dshot>` capable. M5-M8 and LED "
"are the pads shown on the above diagram. M1-M8 and LED outputs support DShot"
" as well as all PWM types. The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr ""
"KakuteH7 Mini 最多支持 9 路输出。M1 至 M4 通过连接器访问，支持 :ref:`双向<bidir-dshot>` 功能。M5-M8 "
"和 LED 为上图所示的焊盘。M1-M8 和 LED 输出支持 DShot 及所有 PWM 类型。PWM 分为 5 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:146
#: 7ed9f2c36c9a4aa7b54e6fc2320d822d
msgid "PWM 1,4 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、4 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:147
#: 9db0d5eae4e1417d8b75f65c5ff5e73a
msgid "PWM 2,3 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 2、3 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:148
#: 430b997c7cb54ae792c999141572bb37
msgid "PWM 5,6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:149
#: 097f002ee18249f6be88cd65ac9b316e
msgid "PWM 7,8 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:150
#: 6dd4a7d2273e4b23987eeb0cf9970ab7
msgid "PWM 9 in group5 (NeoPixel LED by default)"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第 5 组（默认为 NeoPixel LED）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:152
#: f5178fa19a84434e8d220f42de066726
msgid ""
"for users migrating from BetaflightX quads, the first four outputs M1-M4 "
"have been configured for use with existing motor wiring using these default "
"parameters:"
msgstr "对于从 BetaflightX 四轴迁移的用户，前四路输出 M1-M4 已使用以下默认参数配置为与现有电机接线兼容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:154
#: 3e0b04a332984ea985b4f8662caede88
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1 (Quad)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_CLASS<FRAME_CLASS>` = 1（四旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:155
#: 322ad7bc13c84692a69488e2691f894b
msgid ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12 (BetaFlightX)"
msgstr ":ref:`FRAME_TYPE<FRAME_TYPE>` = 12（BetaFlightX）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:158
#: ec2c24604c2145a088204f7b257bd431
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。若某组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:161
#: f9ae213f5afe4978a96d277325e91c0d
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:163
#: 27c42b2e55cc41d5988ad1ff035c1e65
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor. The voltage sensor can handle up to"
" 6S LiPo batteries. An external current sensor can be attached to pin 4 on "
"the ESC connector."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，最高可支持 6S 锂电池。外部电流传感器可连接到 ESC 连接器的第 4 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:167
#: 54d17878a10c4338809dffd387086689
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:169
#: f75726c658ec4811a43e3c29ca06bf46
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4, if external sensor used; 3 for voltage "
"only"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 4（使用外部传感器时）；仅电压监测时设为 3"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:170
#: f2921536b885411894db2077ba2c5c36
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:171
#: 2cd4ea4bfe3c4d909120749e575b3a5c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11 , if external "
"sensor used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11（使用外部传感器时）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:172
#: e5b7524f0beb464481fea72d047980e6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:173
#: ec59c0ae4fa546ed98c0230dae93d4d3
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` should be set"
" to match external current sensor, if used. For example, if the Holybro "
"Tekko32 4in1 ESC is used, this value would be 59.5"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"应根据所用外部电流传感器进行设置（若使用）。例如，若使用 Holybro Tekko32 4合1 ESC，该值应设为 59.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:175
#: b77c00b1f66b4bfd9d5026c206f3b2d7
msgid ""
"these values are already set by default, but can be changed to trim the "
"voltage and/or current as needed, or to suit other ESCs."
msgstr "这些值已默认预设，但可根据需要调整电压和/或电流，或适配其他 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:178
#: 316333f68e874e088496e50bd19f736a
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:180
#: 84fc26d1945e499a8ca95a05c6b243d2
msgid ""
"The KakuteH7 Mini does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteH7 Mini 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:183
#: 1f3d0b8ba3564edaa49cc5723da52319
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:185
#: b28aca87c613493fb80cb78d7e1dc9d2
msgid "The KakuteH7 Mini supports on-board data flash logging."
msgstr "KakuteH7 Mini 支持板载数据闪存日志记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakuteh7mini.rst:188
#: 7d7dfb913a2b4394a169c73793bd0265
